Short:        Arp interface package for Aztec C v5.0. V1.9
Author:       Olaf 'Olsen' Barthel
Version:      1.9
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

An Arp interface package fixed to work with Aztec `C' version 5.0.  An
update to the version on disk 376, and includes a number of bug fixes and a
couple of new features (such as vsprintf/vfprintf/ vprintf-like Arp
routines and fixes for Kickstart 2.0).  
